    ],
    "text": "Land Ministry Ref No.: 4/3/9/2012/WS/366.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      450.05,
      289.08,
      544.85
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land for the construction of water tank and quarters under the Anuradapura North water supply project.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      11.998800277709961
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      546.31,
      286.48,
      656.23
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or servitude to be acquired: An allotments of land depicted as Lot No. 149 in depicted preliminary plan No. FVP 627 prepared on 31.08.2016 by the Anuradapura District Superintendent of surveys in total Extent of 4047 Hectare situated in No. 55 Ethakada Grama Niadhari Division in the village of Ethakada in the Divisional Secretaries Division of Madawachchiya in Anuradapura District and bounded as following.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      346.44,
      539.36,
      379.56
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 149 \u2014 Name of the land: Ethakada-landa Kele; Description: Garden contain mixed cultivation; Claimant of the land: Not Known.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      380.25,
      539.4,
      420.56
    ],
    "text": "North: Lot Nos. 150, 290 and 148; East: Lot Nos. 148 and 147; South: Lot Nos. 147 and 150; West: Lot No. 150.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      421.77,
      541.71,
      557.35
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat Madawachchiya on the 16th day of November, 2016 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 16th day of November, 2016 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.118988037109375,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      555.93,
      533.64,
      598.88
    ],
